  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8cjcZ0E7yXzIKkyveldw17lhoSGcQde20OTvA2B6djM.original.fullsize.png\"><br />equation of $\\mathrm{AC} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{x}+\\mathrm{y}=2$\nequation of line parallel to $\\mathrm{AC} \\mathrm{x}+\\mathrm{y}=\\mathrm{d}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\left|\\frac{\\mathrm{d}-2}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right|=1 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~d}=2-\\sqrt{2}\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\mathrm{eq}^{\\mathrm{n}}$ of new required line\n$\\mathrm{x}+\\mathrm{y}=2-\\sqrt{2}$",
